        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>TC201ADA Global Door Controls Grade 1 ADA Compliant Surface Mount Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nGlobal Series TC201ADA Door Closers provide narrow styling and installation versatility. They are ideal \r\nfor use with aluminum doors and frames, yet it make an attractive installation on wood or metal doors. \r\nThey fit a common 9 1/6\" x 3/4\" mounting hole pattern and packaged complete with wood and machine screws. Direct fit replacement for <a href=\"/products/norton-1600bc-series-door-closer\">Norton 1600 series</a> door closers.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe TC201ADA is the highest rating <b>Grade 1</b> certified and has a <b>25 Year Warranty</b>. \r\nThey are non handed and, for standard non-hold open or hold open applications. They can be \r\nmounted on regular and top jamb installations. An optional mounting bracket is available for parallel installations.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>This closer also available for larger doors: <a href=\"/products/tc201-global-grade-1-surface-mount-door-closer\"><b>Grade 1 with 3-6 Power</b></a></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications and Features: <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TC201ADA-size.pdf?v=1704262215\" target=\"new\">Dimensions (PDF)</b></a>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 243 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 44\" interior / 36\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li><b>Grade 1 (Highest Grade)</b></li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved (UL R7483 615R)</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 1-4</li>\r\n<li>25 Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TC201_Installation_Instructions.pdf?v=1704262174\" target=\"new\"><b>TC201ADA Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe TC201ADA is ADA Compliant offering adjustable spring power sizes 1 - 4 for use on interior doors \r\nrequiring less than 5 lbs. of opening force and exterior doors requiring less than 8.5 lbs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf desired, you can add an optional <a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\">Parallel Arm Bracket PAB-2200 and / or Optional Hold Open Arm HOA-1245</a> below.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/collections/global-tc200-tc400-tc500-tc600-series\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/global-tc2200-arms.jpg?v=1704354566\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories Arms\"></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "TC201ADA Global  Grade 1 ADA Compliant Surface Mount Door Closer",
                "description": "The TC201ADA is the highest rating Grade 1 certified and has a 25 Year Warranty. They fit a common 9 1/6  x 3/4 inches mounting hole pattern and packaged complete with wood and machine screws. The TC201ADA is ADA Compliant offering adjustable spring power sizes 1 - 4.",
